## Key Takeaway

This exercise demonstrated how easily cloud costs can be managed by starting/stopping resources on demand — a core principle of the cloud's pay-as-you-go model. It also reinforced the IaaS model in practice, since managing full access to the OS is essential for cyber security work like installing tools and simulating attacks/defenses.

